    <title>Daily Digest 2026-10-12: Show HN: Foretype: type on remote machines at loca; Show HN: Plimsoll, a self-hosted sandbox for code ; TWiT 1105: Agents Gone Wild - Windows' New Surface</title>
    <updated>2026-10-12T00:00:00Z</updated>
