    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Foretype: type on remote machines at local speed&lt;/b&gt; — Rust/WASM continue to gain production adoption — worth knowing what's newly ergonomic. &lt;a href="https://github.com/itsfabioroma/foretype"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
