&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;TWiT 1105: Agents Gone Wild - Windows' New Surface Laptop Ultra &amp;amp; RTX Spark Dev Box!&lt;/b&gt; — Flagged as relevant to your interests — read the summary to decide if it's worth your time. &lt;a href="https://twit.tv/shows/this-week-in-tech/episodes/1105"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Apple Docs 2.0 MCP – Apple's developer docs and WWDC for coding agents&lt;/b&gt; — Expanding what LLMs can interact with — relevant if you're building or using agentic pipelines. &lt;a href="https://github.com/mishafyi/Apple-Docs-2.0-MCP"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
